sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Owner as Seller (Current Owner)
    actor Buyer as Prospective Buyer
    actor Registrar as Government Sub-Registrar
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Chain as LandRegistry.sol

    Owner->>API: POST /api/transfers (landId, buyerId, reason)
    API->>DB: Insert TransferRequest (PENDING) & Set Land to TRANSFER_PENDING
    API->>Buyer: Send In-App Notification

    Registrar->>API: GET /api/transfers
    Registrar->>API: POST /api/transfers/:id/approve

    API->>DB: Set TransferRequest status to BLOCKCHAIN_PENDING
    API->>Chain: transferOwnership(propertyId, buyerWallet, txRef)
    Chain-->>API: Emit OwnershipTransferred & Return Tx Receipt

    API->>DB: Reassign Land.ownerId to Buyer
    API->>DB: Insert OwnershipHistory record
    API->>DB: Set TransferRequest to COMPLETED
    API->>DB: Record BlockchainTransaction & AuditLog
    API->>Owner: Notify Title Conveyed
    API->>Buyer: Notify Ownership Acquired
